### Login (JWT for the protected /api/** calls below)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jwt.gate@eh8s.local",
  "password": "eh8s-dev-pass1"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Stage queue without Bearer must be 401
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/stage/queue?walletPubkey=7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC

### Stage queue for a wallet without the STAGE (0x04) bit must be 403
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/stage/queue?walletPubkey=U9mzuiHMVUsCw9BLKGibq55BPZuLaxipnvKFvn76Vjq
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Stage queue for the owner (owner keeps every agent power): pending venues + proposed bookings
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/stage/queue?walletPubkey=7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Venue console: listing state + bookings
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/venues/2/onchain
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Build register_venue for venue 2 (venue wallet signs next; listing PDA [venue, wallet, 2 LE])
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/venues/2/register/build
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "U9mzuiHMVUsCw9BLKGibq55BPZuLaxipnvKFvn76Vjq"
}

### register_venue with a non-base58 wallet must be 400
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/venues/2/register/build
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "not-a-wallet"
}

### Forged register confirm: the init_treasury signature (not register_venue) must be 400
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/venues/2/register/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "U9mzuiHMVUsCw9BLKGibq55BPZuLaxipnvKFvn76Vjq",
  "txSignature": "57HQdQXw5KakRBWEqa9kSStuEZant4dqNdTMX4toHLJQUW9QdpfWZYTgiDioNNSgppkRndG8Lzx4j7p2UnEZrjoi"
}

### approve_venue on a venue that is not pending must be 409
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/venues/2/approve/build
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC"
}

### approve_venue by a wallet without STAGE must be 403
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/venues/2/approve/build
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "U9mzuiHMVUsCw9BLKGibq55BPZuLaxipnvKFvn76Vjq"
}

### propose_booking from a wallet that is not the venue wallet must be 403
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/bookings/1/propose/build
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "U9mzuiHMVUsCw9BLKGibq55BPZuLaxipnvKFvn76Vjq",
  "grossUsdc": "1000"
}

### confirm_booking on a booking without escrow must be 409
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/bookings/1/confirm-contract/build
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC"
}

### Settle queue for a wallet without VAULT (0x08) must be 403
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/vault/settle-queue?walletPubkey=U9mzuiHMVUsCw9BLKGibq55BPZuLaxipnvKFvn76Vjq
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Settle queue for the owner: confirmed escrows waiting for settle_booking
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/vault/settle-queue?walletPubkey=7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### settle_booking on a booking that is not confirmed must be 409
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/bookings/1/settle/build
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC"
}
